#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:5 678589e512224e80a9d1df707f16f708
msgid "V-Tail Planes"
msgstr "V 形尾翼飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:7 4c7e97a175f64051ab28c938d01eb2fb
msgid ""
"A common alternative to a traditional elevator and rudder is a V-Tail, or an"
" ATail (an upside down V-Tail)."
msgstr "V 形尾翼（或倒置 V 形尾翼——ATail）是传统升降舵和方向舵的常见替代方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:10 3ac636a2a3774cf7a845257b6b3246cb
msgid ""
"A V-Tail aircraft has the same functionality as a standard aircraft, but it "
"requires special configuration of the servo outputs. Do not use V-Tail "
"mixing on the transmitter. Although you may choose custom channels, the "
"typical V-Tail setup uses channel 2 and 4 for the servo outputs."
msgstr ""
"V 形尾翼飞机与标准飞机功能相同，但需要对舵机输出进行特殊配置。不要在遥控器上使用 V 形尾翼混控。虽然可以选择自定义通道，但典型的 V "
"形尾翼设置使用通道 2 和 4 作为舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:16 8a8ec51c38594bd99f14ce56f9bea131
msgid ""
"Remove the propeller from the aircraft before starting the setup process."
msgstr "在开始设置过程前，从飞机上取下螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:20 3411a6915b324ae0947673c57da1006f
msgid "Configuration & Setup"
msgstr "配置与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:22 0e65a310afc640cbad37ee5ea085aeda
msgid ""
"The most important step to setting up the plane is having the correct "
"inputs, outputs, and reversals. Inputs are covered on the :ref:`RC input "
"setup page <rc-throw-trim>`. After the RC inputs are configured, configure "
"the outputs."
msgstr ""
"设置飞机最重要的步骤是正确的输入、输出和反向。输入在 :ref:`RC input setup page <rc-throw-trim>` "
"中有介绍。配置好 RC 输入后，配置输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:26 1dceabe1428047c4ac38e99f5f84b68c
msgid ""
"Make sure the :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` is set correctly for"
" the autopilot. If it is incorrect, this setup will fail, and the plane may "
"crash upon entry into any stabilize mode."
msgstr ""
"确保 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` "
"已为飞控正确设置。若设置不正确，此步骤将失败，且进入任何稳定模式时飞机可能坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:29 5467aa248c5c4c6eb2cdc65bb3230f5a
msgid ""
"Servo cables can be connected to any output of the autopilot, but using the "
"default channels 1-4 listed below is recommended. Set the SERVOn_FUNCTIONS "
"to the appropriate values."
msgstr "舵机电缆可连接到飞控的任何输出，但建议使用下方默认通道 1-4。将 SERVOn_FUNCTIONS 设为适当值。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:45 ca0e1bef10c446eb9b994c97b1e3a936
msgid "Servo Function & Reversal"
msgstr "舵机功能与反向"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:47 90bfed62d28a40959b5da17b41986153
msgid ""
"The next step is to correct the V-Tail functions and reversals. Both the "
"function and reversal go hand-in-hand, so modifying one may partially change"
" the behavior of the other. Connect the battery (with propeller removed) and"
" turn on the RC transmitter. Switch to FBWA mode using the function switch "
"or a ground station command, and disable the safety switch (if fitted)."
msgstr ""
"下一步是修正 V "
"形尾翼功能和反向设置。功能和反向设置相互关联，修改一个可能会部分改变另一个的行为。连接电池（取下螺旋桨）并打开遥控器。使用功能开关或地面站命令切换到 "
"FBWA 模式，并禁用安全开关（如已安装）。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:54 1fc14ea47218428180217e82229fe038
msgid ""
"When the plane is level, the servos should be near their trim values. Move "
"the plane and leave the transmitter sticks centered while monitoring the "
"control surfaces to determine if the function and reversals are correct. See"
" the table for the correct control surface response to the movements. In "
"each instance, the plane should move its control surfaces to level itself."
msgstr ""
"飞机水平时，舵机应接近其配平值。移动飞机并保持遥控器摇杆居中，同时监控控制舵面以确定功能和反向设置是否正确。参见表格了解飞机运动的正确控制舵面响应。在每种情况下，飞机应移动其控制舵面以使自身保持水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:73 00ae71bf777e4f08b335a50b9979f940
msgid ""
"If the ailerons do not respond correctly, reverse the output by changing the"
" corresponding SERVOn_REVERSED setting (from 0 to 1, or from 1 to 0)."
msgstr "如果副翼响应不正确，通过更改相应的 SERVOn_REVERSED 设置（从 0 改为 1，或从 1 改为 0）来反转输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:76 86bedd22f91941ee9d2f9ce11f34308c
msgid ""
"If the V-tails do not respond correctly, change parameters using the "
"following table to enable the correct behavior. Work on one channel at a "
"time to avoid confusion."
msgstr "如果 V 形尾翼响应不正确，使用以下表格更改参数以启用正确行为。每次只处理一个通道以避免混淆。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:88 3eddf94d059a4ecd8cdfcf0b0675064d
msgid ""
":ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` must not be set to 0 for rudder setup. If "
"the plane actually needs 0, then reset it after this setup."
msgstr "方向舵设置时 :ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` 不得设为 0。如果飞机确实需要 0，则在此设置后重置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:91 6b6a08843a9f459cb81dfd578a79940e
msgid ""
":ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` should cause the tail surfaces point in the "
"direction of the raised aileron."
msgstr ":ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` 应使尾翼面指向上升副翼的方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:96 748cb6f3ac214dbe971fc82051fbac1a
msgid "Confirm RC Transmitter Input"
msgstr "确认遥控器输入"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:98 7bf5f29af869419ca6537617ea77d7f1
msgid "Keep the plane level in FBWA mode and command the following inputs:"
msgstr "在 FBWA 模式下保持飞机水平并发出以下输入："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:112
#: f777830cd9e44649b9c6a2f348750660
msgid ""
"Double check MANUAL mode for the inputs as well. If everything is setup "
"correctly, the plane should be almost ready to fly."
msgstr "同样在 MANUAL 模式下再次检查输入。如果一切设置正确，飞机应几乎可以飞行了。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:116
#: d2d791e043a741c48af03a68b4751ef2
msgid "ATail Planes"
msgstr "ATail 飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:118
#: cfc5bf5b4a824b54953be2af50245da9
msgid ""
"With \"A-Tail\" planes (an inverted V-Tail), the control surface movements "
"referenced above should still be the same directions. It is likely that the "
"servo reversal or function will be opposite from a similar V-Tail setup."
msgstr "对于「A 形尾翼」飞机（倒置 V 形尾翼），上述舵面运动应仍为相同方向。舵机反向或功能设置可能与类似 V 形尾翼设置相反。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:123
#: a7e4e522e74f4764afe78be342a31972
msgid "Servo Trim"
msgstr "舵机配平"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:125
#: 2e671a7901af49edb0fc94620c9745a2
msgid ""
"Switch back to MANUAL mode in order to adjust the servo trim values. The "
"servo trim is in the SERVOn_TRIM parameters."
msgstr "切换回 MANUAL 模式以调整舵机配平值。舵机配平在 SERVOn_TRIM 参数中设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:128
#: c68ae1e01c784aa693731128604a77f0
msgid ""
"Adjust the trim values so that the servo is centered when the transmitter "
"sticks are centered. If the trim value is not between 1450 and 1550 PWM, "
"mechanical trim adjustment is recommended."
msgstr "调整配平值，使遥控器摇杆居中时舵机也处于中立位置。若配平值不在 1450 至 1550 PWM 之间，建议进行机械调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:133
#: 03633c5031644b048bbc66a94d028d02
msgid "Servo Throw"
msgstr "舵机行程"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:135
#: b4311f7f76a84e968ec66600ab8dd026
msgid ""
"Finally adjust the servo throws (range of movement for each of the servos)."
msgstr "最后调整舵机行程（每个舵机的运动范围）。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:138
#: c1aaf388e6694f5cb4e868136f952241
msgid ""
"Check any instructions that came with the plane for suggested throw values. "
"These are often specified in millimeters or inches of movement of the "
"trailing edge of the control surface close to the fuselage. If suggested "
"throw values are not found, then choose a throw that doesn't cause the "
"servos to \"bind\" (often indicated by a high pitched sound when servos "
"stall)."
msgstr ""
"查阅飞机附带的说明书获取建议行程值，通常以操纵面靠近机身处后缘的运动毫米数或英寸数表示。若没有建议行程值，则选择一个不会导致舵机「卡死」的行程（通常以舵机失速时发出高音蜂鸣声为提示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:145
#: be3090af47494d16beac67caf889dc8e
msgid ""
"To adjust the throw, change the SERVOn_MIN and SERVOn_MAX values. The "
"defaults are 1100 to 1900. On many aircraft, more throw may be desired. "
"Changing throws to 1000 to 2000 or beyond is normal. Make sure that the "
"servos are still moving when nearing the extreme values."
msgstr ""
"要调整行程，更改 SERVOn_MIN 和 SERVOn_MAX 值。默认值为 1100 至 1900。在许多飞机上，可能需要更大的行程。将行程更改为 "
"1000 至 2000 或更大是正常的。确保舵机在接近极端值时仍在运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:150
#: 2ccd2269c8864c478539d21cb6d3fde7
msgid ""
"To get to maximum throw on V-Tail control surfaces, command pitch and yaw at"
" the same time in MANUAL mode."
msgstr "要在 V 形尾翼控制舵面上获得最大行程，在 MANUAL 模式下同时输入俯仰和偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:154
#: f9e950bd8c624e25a015fd09255cea73
msgid "Mixing Gain"
msgstr "混控增益"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:156
#: 8360f47d014b4cc28f75266da8b34c02
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` parameter is critical for vtail "
"aircraft. It is the gain used in mixing between yaw and pitch output and the"
" vtail movement. For example, if :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` is 0.5, "
"then the following outputs are used:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 参数对于 V 形尾翼飞机至关重要。它是偏航和俯仰输出与 V "
"形尾翼运动之间混控使用的增益。例如，如果 :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 为 0.5，则使用以下输出："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:161
#: 03588388a3a54a86bd7c8468ae7add6b
msgid "LEFT_VTAIL = (yaw+pitch)*0.5"
msgstr "LEFT_VTAIL = (yaw+pitch)*0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:162
#: 9d0b97ad65cb49c295276b0336979a0e
msgid "RIGHT_VTAIL = (-yaw+pitch)*0.5"
msgstr "RIGHT_VTAIL = (-yaw+pitch)*0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:164
#: b87ac93ce13d4706a01a52ebf33adc63
msgid ""
"Adjusting the :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` controls the percentage of "
"throws from pitch vs yaw."
msgstr "调整 :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 控制俯仰与偏航行程的百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:167
#: 4b1063a7c64f44a1820c444a8f5483ed
msgid "Final Setup"
msgstr "最终设置"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-vtail-plane.rst:169
#: 50ac189a4278447c88cdbe18fb497851
msgid ""
"After completing the V-Tail guide, move onto the final setup of the "
"aircraft."
msgstr "完成 V 形尾翼指南后，进行飞机的最终设置。"

